    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for edk2 is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "EDK II is a modern, feature-rich, cross-platform firmware development environment for the UEFI and PI specifications.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nAn insecure default to allow UEFI Shell in EDK2 was left enabled in LXD. This allows an OS-resident attacker to bypass Secure Boot.(CVE-2023-49721)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for edk2 is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of medium. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Medium",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "edk2",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
